    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### What the two latency graphs are for\n\n`ash predict` reaches a deployment through the **Kubernetes API server's proxy**, and that is deliberately *not* the serving path \u2014 real traffic goes to `endpoint_url` from inside the cluster. Every request on this dashboard occupied the event loop that also runs the scheduler.\n\nSo two histograms are exported: the **round trip** AshML measured, and the **forward pass** the model server measured for itself. The difference between them is this control plane plus the proxy, and it is measured rather than asserted \u2014 `docs/benchmarks.md` records 120\u2013160 ms of it. Reporting only the model's number would credit the platform with a latency it does not deliver."
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Replicas \u2014 asked for, and ready",
      "description": "Two series rather than one health flag, because \"is it up\" and \"how far short is it\" are different questions and only the second is useful during a rollout or an outage. A deleted deployment stops reporting entirely \u2014 absence here means the row is gone, not that it has zero replicas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "ashml_deployment_replicas_desired",
          "legendFormat": "{{project}}/{{deployment}} \u00b7 desired",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "ashml_deployment_replicas_ready",
          "legendFormat": "{{project}}/{{deployment}} \u00b7 ready",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Round trip, through the control plane and the API server proxy",
      "description": "Failures are timed too, and deliberately: a deployment refusing in 4 ms and one timing out at 15 s are both \"failing\", and a histogram of successes only would show neither. Split them with the outcome panel below.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(ashml_prediction_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(ashml_prediction_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(ashml_prediction_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
