      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "What is not the model \u2014 round trip minus forward pass (p50)",
      "description": "The measured form of \"this is not the serving path\". Two independently estimated quantiles subtracted, so treat it as an order of magnitude rather than a precise figure \u2014 but the order of magnitude is the point, and it is why production traffic must not come through here.",
